<article><header><h1 viak="article">81 years of US cycle
</h1></header><h3><a href="https://viakviak.livejournal.com/76661.html#method" target="_blank">Предположение</a></h3><span viak="summary">
The following is the 81 years cycle of the US big victories: 1783 - US Revolution, 1864 - Civil War, 1945 - World War Two, 2026 - ?
</span><span viak="description">
1. The American Revolution spanned from 1765 to 1783.
2. The American Civil War took place from April 12, 1861, to April 9, 1865. (96-82)
3. World War II took place from September 1, 1939, to September 2, 1945. (78-80)
4. The first cases of what would become known as COVID-19 were detected in Wuhan, China, in December 2019. (80-81)
